  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "In this course, consumers are people with relevant lived experience",
      "startMs": 70,
      "endMs": 3910,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "and expertise of a health condition or issue,",
      "startMs": 3910,
      "endMs": 6490,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "including carers.",
      "startMs": 6779,
      "endMs": 7900,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "They contribute their knowledge and perspectives",
      "startMs": 8485,
      "endMs": 10950,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "to inform and shape innovation.",
      "startMs": 10950,
      "endMs": 12720,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Being a patient or carer gives someone experience,",
      "startMs": 13728,
      "endMs": 16553,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "but it does not automatically mean they are involved",
      "startMs": 16888,
      "endMs": 19230,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "in developing an innovation.",
      "startMs": 19230,
      "endMs": 20679,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "What matters is the role they are invited to play,",
      "startMs": 21286,
      "endMs": 23943,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "helping a team understand a need,",
      "startMs": 24562,
      "endMs": 26290,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "question an assumption,",
      "startMs": 26717,
      "endMs": 27925,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "consider options",
      "startMs": 28305,
      "endMs": 29328,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "or inform a decision.",
      "startMs": 29529,
      "endMs": 30741,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "People with lived experience do not need to become overnight experts",
      "startMs": 31848,
      "endMs": 34670,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "in science or technology.",
      "startMs": 34670,
      "endMs": 36990,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Their expertise is their lived experience,",
      "startMs": 37555,
      "endMs": 39918,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "bringing a relevant and realistic perspective",
      "startMs": 40303,
      "endMs": 42607,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "that can help make an innovation better.",
      "startMs": 42754,
      "endMs": 44595,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "It is also important to consider whose lived experience",
      "startMs": 45588,
      "endMs": 48730,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "voices are needed at each stage,",
      "startMs": 48730,
      "endMs": 50489,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "from concept and design,",
      "startMs": 50902,
      "endMs": 52224,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "through implementation",
      "startMs": 52500,
      "endMs": 53635,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "to delivery,",
      "startMs": 53764,
      "endMs": 54378,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "so the innovation can have the greatest impact.",
      "startMs": 54805,
      "endMs": 57000,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ]
